# The agent's live config. Install-Agent.ps1 writes the pairing code and the
# Vercel protection-bypass secret into it, so committing it would publish
# working credentials. The .example file is the one that belongs in git.
agent/agent.config.json

# Project development journal.
#
# Deliberately not published. It records the edit key, an inventory of the
# application's current security gaps, and infrastructure notes — a map of
# exactly where to attack this deployment. It stays on the developer machine
# until the repository is private AND the read API is authenticated.
CLAUDE.md
